@startuml
title Staff Service - Staff Auth And Profile
actor StaffUser as Staff
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "StaffViewSet" as StaffAPI
database "Staff DB" as DB
participant "TokenAuth" as TokenAuth

== Register staff ==
Staff -> Gateway: POST /api/staff/register
Gateway -> StaffAPI: register(data)
StaffAPI -> DB: Create User + Staff
DB --> StaffAPI: created
StaffAPI --> Gateway: 201 staff registered
Gateway --> Staff: 201 staff registered

== Login staff ==
Staff -> Gateway: POST /api/staff/login
Gateway -> StaffAPI: login(email/password)
StaffAPI -> TokenAuth: authenticate()
TokenAuth --> StaffAPI: user
StaffAPI -> DB: Load Staff + token
DB --> StaffAPI: staff + token
StaffAPI --> Gateway: token, staff
Gateway --> Staff: token, staff

== Me/Profile ==
Staff -> Gateway: GET /api/staff/me
Gateway -> StaffAPI: me(Token)
StaffAPI -> TokenAuth: validate token
StaffAPI -> DB: Load Staff profile, roles
DB --> StaffAPI: staff profile
StaffAPI --> Gateway: staff profile
Gateway --> Staff: staff profile
@enduml

